<br><br>
Schuldbrief von 1613 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 8 -- P8a_0089 r -- 1613-12-09 -- Schuldbrief): <i>Thoman Pinder z Drossing Riedererischer nach Pülhaim Untertan</i></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hof in Uraufnahme</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">keine Daten vorhanden</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Weitere Informationen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= "_blank" href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=dcee3b02941f4473a3d368ed6bd3d03c">Weitere Informationen zum Hof anzeigen</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Belegte Hofbesitzer</b></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 35%;"><b>Besitzer belegt in</b></td><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 65%;"><b>Name des Hofbesitzers</b></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;">1613</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=896527f5900c4cf1a671f0ad116d86af" target="_blank">Pünder, Thomas</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 1cm; background-color: white;"></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 1cm; vertical-align: middle;">Stand der Daten: Tue Jun  2 22:13:28 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></description><Style><IconStyle><scale>0.5</scale><Icon><href>https://geoportal.bayern.de/ba-backend/icons/255,128,0/triangle</href><gx:w>48</gx:w><gx:h>48</gx:h></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff000000</color></LabelStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>13.32493,48.43764,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
