<Placemark><name>Oberendholzner OR Unterendholzner</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Oberendholzner OR Unterendholzner</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Entholz (Pfr Münchham - DE-94140)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/4 HM Malching</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">[Gmkg Münchham No 76 OR 77] 
