<br><br>
Übergabe von 1635 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 22 -- P22a_0030 r -- 1635-07-10 -- Besitzwechsel & Ausnahme): <i>das verleibgedingte Stiglpaur Guet z Khindlbach ein ganzer "doch schlechter" Hof mit Grundeigentum dem Gotteshaus u Kloster Aspach gehörig</i></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hof in Uraufnahme</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= '_blank' href='https://geoportal.bayern.de/bayernatlas/?zoom=15&bgLayer=historisch&lang=de&topic=ba&E=807825&N=5371437&catalogNodes=122&crosshair=marker'>Klicken um Hof in Uraufnahme anzuzeigen</a></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Weitere Informationen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= "_blank" href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=27972b0f38304f7fac15a2435fa2393d">Weitere Informationen zum Hof anzeigen</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Belegte Hofbesitzer</b></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 35%;"><b>Besitzer belegt in</b></td><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 65%;"><b>Name des Hofbesitzers</b></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;">von 1587 bis 1609-01</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=c020eb3cd8924d7eb3055432c2c4b61c" target="_blank">Stiglpaur, Khillian (Sigmundt)</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">von 1609-01 bis 1635-07</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=1f39430cf07940119c9d8c11f57c841b" target="_blank">Stiglpaur, Georg</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1635-07</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=de1f4075750343f3a2a719a41ecc6db7" target="_blank">Paumgarttner, Hanns</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">3. Viertel 17.Jhdt.</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=40e64b9eb9804927822d6e88b042bc50" target="_blank">Stiglpaur, Simon</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1685-03</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=0836024ecc524d819024b4b72d47c1b1" target="_blank">Ohrttner, Georg</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1717-08</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=0ee97b287f134aabb42ce999387daeca" target="_blank">Stiglpaur, Stephanus</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">letztes Viertel 18.Jhdt.</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=172c510e441a4a86a2a8ed73b10992d7" target="_blank">Obernhueber, Jacobus</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">1793</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=9ca8d2721a8b444cbcc16df2194485cc" target="_blank">Hueber, Petrus</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1803</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=0eb3c4778dd247938fd87ea254d067e3" target="_blank">Obernhuber, Jacobus</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1822-12</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=16db099945c34ab3b8424abddc22b3a8" target="_blank">Hieserer, Gertrudis</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1847-02</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=0a30a5079ad34fc2aa9a015c42227064" target="_blank">(Hießerer) Obernhuber, Georgius</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 1cm; background-color: white;"></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 1cm; vertical-align: middle;">Stand der Daten: Tue Jun  2 22:13:28 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></description><Style><IconStyle><scale>0.5</scale><Icon><href>https://geoportal.bayern.de/ba-backend/icons/255,0,0/circle</href><gx:w>48</gx:w><gx:h>48</gx:h></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff000000</color></LabelStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>013.16096000,48.42077000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
