<tr><td style="width: 35%;">von 1731-11 bis 1778-06</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=054300d850114299a929d32f8dd84c90" target="_blank">Ränzinger, Andreas</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">von 1778-05 bis 1822-01</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=b8d2ad2277374e60b06ec2e8bdd00dd6" target="_blank">Ranzinger, Joseph</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1831-09</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=cf987379fb144810a1e3457ff7cb0458" target="_blank">Ranzinger, Joseph</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1861-06</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=51bef83c06484494861b735d3b3c8b8c" target="_blank">Ranzinger, Georg</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1895-05</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=f84443d9c2d54dc5bfd9a334271b7e5c" target="_blank">Ranzinger, Georg</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 1cm; background-color: white;"></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 1cm; vertical-align: middle;">Stand der Daten: Tue Jun  2 22:13:28 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></description><Style><IconStyle><scale>0.5</scale><Icon><href>https://geoportal.bayern.de/ba-backend/icons/255,0,0/circle</href><gx:w>48</gx:w><gx:h>48</gx:h></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff000000</color></LabelStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>013.28887000,48.43250000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Reislhuber</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Reislhuber</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Ruhstorf (Pfr - DE-94099)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/4 HM Ruhstorf</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Ruhstorf a d Rott No 25</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Reislhuber z Ruhstorf (Pfr - DE-94099) [1/4 HM Ruhstorf]</i>
<br><br>
Hofmarksbeschreibung von 1580 (DE-BayHStA, Kurbayern Geheimes Landesarchiv 1067 -- KurBy_GLA_1067_0087 r [fol: 88r] -- Abschnitt Besitzungen Georg Ruhstorfer z Ruhstorf): <i>Michael Reislhueber -- 1 Hueb daselbst -- ist freis Aigen</i>
<br><br>
Schuldbrief von 1613 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 8 -- P8a_0051 r -- 1613-07-01 -- Schuldbrief): <i>Hanns Reislhueber z Ruestorf Ruestorfferischer Untertan</i>
<br><br>
Schuldbrief von 1619 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 12 -- P12b_146v -- 1619-02-26 -- Schuldbrief): <i>Hanns Reislhueber z Ruestorf ... G[riesbacher]:G[ericht]</i>
<br><br>
Schuldbrief von 1622 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 14 -- P14b_199v -- 1622-03-16 -- Schuldbrief): <i>Hanns Haizinger z Haizing; Hanns Reißlhueber z Ruestorf beide Ruestorfferische aldahin gehörige Untersessen</i></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hof in Uraufnahme</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= '_blank' href='https://geoportal.bayern.de/bayernatlas/?zoom=15&bgLayer=historisch&lang=de&topic=ba&E=820578&N=5373907&catalogNodes=122&crosshair=marker'>Klicken um Hof in Uraufnahme anzuzeigen</a></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Weitere Informationen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= "_blank" href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=29ea8e4afb7c4982a09eed8059167231">Weitere Informationen zum Hof anzeigen</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Belegte Hofbesitzer</b></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 35%;"><b>Besitzer belegt in</b></td><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 65%;"><b>Name des Hofbesitzers</b></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;">1580</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=836ab5dafac24c22993af186da42afb3" target="_blank">Reislhueber, Michael</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">1602</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=46a164cc7f2a4b67a314ee96c327badc" target="_blank">Obernreiter, Georg</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1607</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=91a06b27d12d448daaa0e561782de89f" target="_blank">Andorfer, Hans</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1639-11</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=657444ed8f6f48659e4efe55a09733c1" target="_blank">Reislhueber, Joannes</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1683</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=011392a7db1543bebd17c1cf7c7ced42" target="_blank">Reißlhueber, Jacobus</a></td></tr>
