<Placemark><name>Simpöck</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Simpöck</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Dorfbach (Pfr Rainding - DE-94496)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 HM Dorfbach</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Dorfbach No 3</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Simpöck z Dorfbach (Pfr Rainding - DE-94496) [1/2 HM Dorfbach]</i>
<br><br>
Schuldbrief von 1608 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 3 -- P3c_0191 l [SNr: 378] -- 1608-02-14 -- Schuldbrief): <i>Georg Simpeckh z Dorfpach Nothaffischer Undterthon</i>
<br><br>
