<Placemark><name>Krölpaur Krölln-Gut Grollbauer</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Krölpaur Krölln-Gut Grollbauer</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Veicht (Pfr Kirchham - DE-94060)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/4 Kl St Salvator</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Kühnham No 58</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Krölpaur Krölln-Gut Grollbauer z Veicht (Pfr Kirchham - DE-94060) [1/4 Kl St Salvator]</i>
