<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1726</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=b72a4f4d56634fd79063bb39b9c63e6a" target="_blank">Lienbauer, Peter</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 1cm; background-color: white;"></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 1cm; vertical-align: middle;">Stand der Daten: Tue Jun  2 22:13:29 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></description><Style><IconStyle><scale>0.5</scale><Icon><href>https://geoportal.bayern.de/ba-backend/icons/255,0,0/circle</href><gx:w>48</gx:w><gx:h>48</gx:h></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff000000</color></LabelStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>013.13636000,48.42909000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Kroißen Kroißen-Sölde</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Kroißen Kroißen-Sölde</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Steinbach (Pfr Rainding - DE-94496)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/8 Kl St Salvator</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Dorfbach No 53</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Kroißen Kroißen-Sölde z Steinbach (Pfr Rainding - DE-94496) [1/8 Kl St Salvator]</i>
