<Placemark><name>Mühlhammer Michlbauer</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Mühlhammer Michlbauer</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Berg (Pfr Pocking - DE-94060)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/1 HM Eggersham</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Pocking No 60</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Mühlhammer Michlbauer z Berg (Pfr Pocking - DE-94060) [1/1 HM Eggersham]</i>
