<Placemark><name>Fridl</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Fridl</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Friedlbauer i Kälberbach (Pfr Neukirchen a Inn - DE-94127)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">3.00 Grfscht Neuburg a Inn</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Neukirchen a Inn No 28</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Fridl z Friedlbauer i Kälberbach (Pfr Neukirchen a Inn - DE-94127) [3.00 Grfscht Neuburg a Inn]</i>
<br><br>
Urkataster von 1844 (DE-StALa, Grundsteuerkataster 8007 -- S 8): Haus No <i>28</i>; Ortschaft <i>Kelberbach</i>; Name <i>Fridl // Martin Hausmann // Seit 24/11 49 Philipp Asperreiter</i></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hof in Uraufnahme</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= '_blank' href='https://geoportal.bayern.de/bayernatlas/?zoom=15&bgLayer=historisch&lang=de&topic=ba&E=824251&N=5383704&catalogNodes=122&crosshair=marker'>Klicken um Hof in Uraufnahme anzuzeigen</a></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Weitere Informationen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;"><a target= "_blank" href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=56274f927a9e431fa8e984c306c9cebe">Weitere Informationen zum Hof anzeigen</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td><br></td></tr><tr><td><b>Belegte Hofbesitzer</b></td></tr><tr><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 35%;"><b>Besitzer belegt in</b></td><td style="background-color: #cccccc;width: 65%;"><b>Name des Hofbesitzers</b></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1643-04</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=d17afc582812446ca96f7405301f2700" target="_blank">Bierndorffer, Joannes</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">von 1671 bis 1715-03</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=5fd3a850435b42cbb0ace84b9c8909bd" target="_blank">Paumgartner, Mathiaß</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">vor 1676 - nur über Kinder belegt</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=d17afc582812446ca96f7405301f2700" target="_blank">Bierndorffer, Joannes</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1717-04</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=3870725f7b7049f4acddfe309b5b2a86" target="_blank">Baumgartner, Martin</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1723-07</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=4a1a1fbb80684d829440186b3717b2c9" target="_blank">Haußman, Michael</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1760-01</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=284e2ab3130944e8ac1b087ed0a9849e" target="_blank">Hausman, Joseph</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1786-07</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=f80528ea2d284d44a3dc53babb02666b" target="_blank">Ellinger, Joseph</a></td></tr>
