<Placemark><name>Aichinger Aichinger-Hof</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Aichinger Aichinger-Hof</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Trostling (Pfr Ruhstorf a d Rott - DE-94099)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 Kl Vornbach a Inn</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Ruhstorf a d Rott No 41</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Aichinger Aichinger-Hof z Trostling (Pfr Ruhstorf a d Rott - DE-94099) [1/2 Kl Vornbach a Inn]</i>
