<Placemark><name>Weber Rothweber</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Weber Rothweber</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Bergham (Pfr Uttlau/Haarbach - DE-94542)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/8 HM Bergham Sachsenham</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Sachsenham No 77</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Weber Rothweber z Bergham (Pfr Uttlau/Haarbach - DE-94542) [1/8 HM Bergham Sachsenham]</i>
<br><br>
