<Placemark><name>Müller Kohlmüller</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Müller Kohlmüller</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Afham (Pfr Mittich - DE-94152)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/8 Kl Vornbach a Inn</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Mittich No 55</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Müller Kohlmüller z Afham (Pfr Mittich - DE-94152) [1/8 Kl Vornbach a Inn]</i>
