<Placemark><name>Klessinger vorm Waldt Glesinger</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Klessinger vorm Waldt Glesinger</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Klessing (Pfr Holzkirchen - DE-94081)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/8 HM Söldenau</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Voglarn No 21</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Klessinger vorm Waldt Glesinger z Klessing (Pfr Holzkirchen - DE-94081) [1/8 HM Söldenau]</i>
<br><br>
