<Placemark><name>Wendinger Wendinger-Hof Weidinger</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Wendinger Wendinger-Hof Weidinger</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Prenzing (Pfr Hartkirchen a Inn - DE-94060)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 Kl Vornbach a Inn</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Indling No 51</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Wendinger Wendinger-Hof Weidinger z Prenzing (Pfr Hartkirchen a Inn - DE-94060) [1/2 Kl Vornbach a Inn]</i>
<br><br>
