<Placemark><name>Muxensölden</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Muxensölden</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Inzing (Pfr Hartkirchen a Inn - DE-94060)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/8 Kl Suben § LG PAN</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Hartkirchen No 77</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB (Pfarrkirchen): <i>Muxensölden z Inzing (Pfr Hartkirchen a Inn - DE-94060) [1/8 Kl Suben § LG PAN]</i>
<br><br>
