<Placemark><name>Hofbauer Paur am Hof zu Rainding</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Hofbauer Paur am Hof zu Rainding</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Hof (Pfr Rainding - DE-94542)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 HM Reisbach</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Sachsenham No 23</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Hofbauer Paur am Hof zu Rainding z Hof (Pfr Rainding - DE-94542) [1/2 HM Reisbach]</i>
<br><br>
