<Placemark><name>Sager Langkindl Sager-Gut Langhindl-Gut</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Sager Langkindl Sager-Gut Langhindl-Gut</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Sagmühle (Pfr Bayerbach - DE-94137)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/4 Kl Asbach</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Kindlbach No 53</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Sager Langkindl Sager-Gut Langhindl-Gut z Sagmühle (Pfr Bayerbach - DE-94137) [1/4 Kl Asbach]</i>
<br><br>
