<Placemark><name>Kolman</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Kolman</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Kollmannsöd (Pfr Weihmörting - DE-94060)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 HM Neudeck</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Kühnham No 39</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Kolman z Kollmannsöd (Pfr Weihmörting - DE-94060) [1/2 HM Neudeck]</i>
