<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1664-06</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=31e837dc3f224e919533d51343a292da" target="_blank">Hausberger, Andreas</a></td></tr>
<tr><td style="width: 35%;">nach 1686-01</td><td style="width: 65%;"><a href="https://landgericht-griesbach.info/NAVWEB/display_page.php?page=58f9fdfab5d94b6dbf4c0e0e39e8ba39" target="_blank">Wagner, Wolfgang</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><table style="width: 100%;" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="height: 1cm; background-color: white;"></td></tr><tr><td style="height: 1cm; vertical-align: middle;">Stand der Daten: Tue Jun  2 22:13:30 2026</td></tr></tbody></table></div>]]></description><Style><IconStyle><scale>0.5</scale><Icon><href>https://geoportal.bayern.de/ba-backend/icons/255,0,0/circle</href><gx:w>48</gx:w><gx:h>48</gx:h></Icon></IconStyle><LabelStyle><color>ff000000</color></LabelStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>013.26025000,48.46352000,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Hofpaur Hopper</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Hofpaur Hopper</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Bergham (Pfr Uttlau/Haarbach - DE-94542)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 HM Rothenbergham</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Sachsenham No 60</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Hofpaur Hopper z Bergham (Pfr Uttlau/Haarbach - DE-94542) [1/2 HM Rothenbergham]</i>
<br><br>
Quittung von 1614 (DE-StALa, Pfleggericht Griesbach (Rep. 216/6) P 8 -- P8b_0134 l -- 1614-05-16 -- Quittung): <i>Hanns Moser z Mos u Caspar Hofpaur z Rotenperkhaim beide Offenhaimerische Untertanen</i>
<br><br>
