<Placemark><name>Pirndorffer Birndorfer-Hof Zubau Graf Zubau-Hof</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Pirndorffer Birndorfer-Hof Zubau Graf Zubau-Hof</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Birndorf (Pfr Karpfham - DE-94167)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/1+1/2 St Berchtesgaden</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Poigham No 11</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Pirndorffer Birndorfer-Hof Zubau Graf Zubau-Hof z Birndorf (Pfr Karpfham - DE-94167) [1/1+1/2 St Berchtesgaden]</i>
