<Placemark><name>Werner-Hof Wörer zu Wöhr</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Werner-Hof Wörer zu Wöhr</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Wierer zu Eden i Eden (Pfr Tettenweis/Hader - DE-94099)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/4 Kl St Nikola</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Hütting No 71</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Werner-Hof Wörer zu Wöhr z Wierer zu Eden i Eden (Pfr Tettenweis/Hader - DE-94099) [1/4 Kl St Nikola]</i>
