<Placemark><name>Prambhofer Wagner-Hub</name><description><![CDATA[<div><table style="width: 100%; float: left;" cellpadding="5" border="1"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hofname(n)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Prambhofer Wagner-Hub</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Ort (Pfarrei)</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Weihmörting (Pfr Sulzbach a Inn - DE-94152)</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Hoffuß/Stift/Grundherr</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">1/2 DK Passau</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Haus Nr in Urkataster</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Gmkg Vornbach a Inn No 66 & 67</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 35%;"><b>Bemerkungen</b></td><td style="width: 65%;">Nennung im HAB: <i>Prambhofer Wagner-Hub z Weihmörting (Pfr Sulzbach a Inn - DE-94152) [1/2 DK Passau]</i>
<br><br>
